      "cooked": "<p>So playing last night against ambuscade I ran into something that i'm not sure i did correctly. He pops stim packs, which heals him then shuffles the trash into the deck then he plays another card. (i think it's stim packs, but the base problem is there no matter what the darned card is called) when does the card his the trash? does it go before the shuffle, right after it's played, or does it wait until all text has been resolved before it hits, causing the shuffle then entering the trash afterwords?</p>",
