      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-30T17:47:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Cards only go to the trash once they've been fully resolved, so it has to be at the end, after the shuffle and the second play.&nbsp; In fact, others can correct me if I'm wrong, but I think it wouldn't hit the trash until the second card has been fully resolved too, because once an effect on a card triggers another effect, that second effect gets fully resolved before continuing with the first card.&nbsp; Do I have that correct?</p>",
